        },
        {
          "text": "Oyako jami ma gikano i ot lim pa Rwot, ki jami ma gikano i ot lim pa kabaka, Oyako jami woko ducu, oyako ki kwodi jabu ma yam Solomon otiyogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
